WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.872
Wukong landed on another mountain peak.

2
00:00:04.873 --> 00:00:09.806
[g@"Ah-choo!" The monkey groaned.

3
00:00:09.807 --> 00:00:12.885
"That fire and smoke were awful!@g]

4
00:00:12.886 --> 00:00:19.340
And the sand went right in—ah-ah-choo!—my nose."

5
00:00:19.341 --> 00:00:22.419
He looked at the Demon of Power's mountain.

6
00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.466
The fire and smoke were now gone.

7
00:00:25.467 --> 00:00:29.485
[g@Wukong was about to return to that mountain.

8
00:00:29.486 --> 00:00:32.101
But then he hesitated.@g]

9
00:00:32.102 --> 00:00:36.151
"The demon will just use the same trick again," thought the monkey.

10
00:00:36.152 --> 00:00:38.802
"I'll sneak into his cave and look around.

11
00:00:38.803 --> 00:00:44.304
Maybe I can find out how he created the fire, smoke, and sand."

12
00:00:44.305 --> 00:00:53.678
Wukong turned into a bug and flew back to the demon's mountain.

13
00:00:53.679 --> 00:01:00.315
He went into the cave and flew down a long, dark tunnel.

14
00:01:00.316 --> 00:01:07.840
He soon found a brightly lit bedroom filled with nice furniture and fancy decorations.

15
00:01:07.841 --> 00:01:11.546
[g@In a corner a woman sat in a chair.

16
00:01:11.547 --> 00:01:13.907
She was crying.@g]

17
00:01:13.908 --> 00:01:17.722
[i@Poof!@i] Wukong turned back into himself.

18
00:01:17.723 --> 00:01:21.902
"Oh!" cried the woman. "Wh-who are you?"

19
00:01:21.903 --> 00:01:25.280
[g@"My name is Sun Wukong," said the monkey.

20
00:01:25.281 --> 00:01:27.026
"Are you the queen?"@g]

21
00:01:27.027 --> 00:01:29.143
The woman nodded.

22
00:01:29.144 --> 00:01:33.118
"Your husband sent me to rescue you," said Wukong.

23
00:01:33.119 --> 00:01:36.400
The queen's face broke into a smile.

24
00:01:36.401 --> 00:01:37.879
[g@"Oh, please do!

25
00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:43.347
The demon who kidnapped me is horrible—nasty, ugly, smelly!"@g]

26
00:01:43.348 --> 00:01:45.232
[g@The queen shivered.

27
00:01:45.233 --> 00:01:49.848
"He said he loves me and wants to . . . m-marry me!"@g]

28
00:01:49.849 --> 00:01:52.769
The queen started to cry again.

29
00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:55.734
[g@"Don't worry, Your Majesty," said Wukong.

30
00:01:55.735 --> 00:01:57.424
"I'll defeat the demon.@g]

31
00:01:57.425 --> 00:02:02.210
But first I must figure out how he creates the fire, smoke, and sand."

32
00:02:02.211 --> 00:02:05.379
"That's simple." The queen sniffed.

33
00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:07.246
[g@"He has three bells.

34
00:02:07.247 --> 00:02:09.506
The first bell makes fire.@g]

35
00:02:09.507 --> 00:02:11.721
[g@The second bell makes smoke.

36
00:02:11.722 --> 00:02:14.978
And the third bell makes sand."@g]

37
00:02:14.979 --> 00:02:17.781
[g@"I saw the bells," said Wukong.

38
00:02:17.782 --> 00:02:19.688
"He wears them around his neck."@g]

39
00:02:19.689 --> 00:02:21.215
[g@The monkey smiled.

40
00:02:21.216 --> 00:02:23.062
"You wait here, Your Majesty.@g]

41
00:02:23.063 --> 00:02:25.916
Tonight I'll steal those bells from the demon.

42
00:02:25.917 --> 00:02:29.739
Once I defeat him, I'll come back and rescue you."

43
00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:37.531
The monkey turned back into a bug and flew down another tunnel.

44
00:02:37.532 --> 00:02:41.402
[g@Soon he found a second bedroom.

45
00:02:41.403 --> 00:02:44.611
This one was dark and gloomy.@g]

46
00:02:44.612 --> 00:02:48.348
"This must be the demon's bedroom," thought Wukong.

47
00:02:48.349 --> 00:02:53.078
"I'll wait here until the demon goes to sleep."

48
00:02:53.079 --> 00:02:56.948
He landed on the ceiling and waited.

49
00:02:56.949 --> 00:03:01.624
A little while later, the Demon of Power came into the room.

50
00:03:01.625 --> 00:03:05.800
Wukong could see the bells tied around the demon's neck.

51
00:03:05.801 --> 00:03:13.483
"What a busy day," said the demon. "I'm tired."

52
00:03:13.484 --> 00:03:17.780
[g@The demon climbed into bed and closed his eyes.

53
00:03:17.781 --> 00:03:21.035
Soon he was snoring loudly.@g]

54
00:03:21.036 --> 00:03:24.155
Wukong turned back into himself.

55
00:03:24.156 --> 00:03:30.073
He plucked a few of his hairs and turned them into fleas.

56
00:03:30.074 --> 00:03:34.168
The fleas landed on the demon's neck and began biting.

57
00:03:34.169 --> 00:03:37.666
The demon scratched at his neck and rolled over.

58
00:03:37.667 --> 00:03:41.120
[g@Then he scratched some more—and more.

59
00:03:41.121 --> 00:03:43.533
Finally the demon sat up.@g]

60
00:03:43.534 --> 00:03:47.914
"Why is my neck so itchy?" he said.

61
00:03:47.915 --> 00:03:49.927
[g@"Maybe it's these bells.

62
00:03:49.928 --> 00:03:52.820
I'll take them off while I sleep."@g]

63
00:03:52.821 --> 00:03:56.338
The demon laid the three bells on a table.

64
00:03:56.339 --> 00:03:59.816
A few minutes later he was snoring again.

65
00:03:59.817 --> 00:04:04.461
The fleas turned back into hairs and returned to Wukong.

66
00:04:04.462 --> 00:04:09.603
Next the monkey turned the hairs into three fake bells.

67
00:04:09.604 --> 00:04:14.367
He put them on the table and stuck the real bells in his robe.

68
00:04:14.368 --> 00:04:16.913
He looked at the sleeping demon.

69
00:04:16.914 --> 00:04:21.473
"It's too dangerous to use these bells inside," thought the monkey.

70
00:04:21.474 --> 00:04:26.497
"I'll get the demon to come outside, and then I'll fight him."

71
00:04:26.498 --> 00:04:31.949
Wukong became invisible and ran back through the tunnel.

72
00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:36.230
[g@A guard was sleeping next to the cave entrance.

73
00:04:36.231 --> 00:04:42.338
Wukong sneaked past him.@g]

74
00:04:42.339 --> 00:04:46.329
Once he was outside, the monkey shouted.

75
00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:48.887
[g@"Return the queen right now!

76
00:04:48.888 --> 00:04:56.600
If you don't, I'll smash your entire mountain!"@g]

